s: 10.86mm folded and 5.26mm unfolded\u003c/span\u003e⁸\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri\"\u003eWeight: 255g\u003c/span\u003e⁸\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri\"\u003eColor: Black\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri\"\u003e5-layer composite fiber back cover\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri\"\u003eGlass variant\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri\"\u003eThickness: 10.96mm folded and 5.26mm unfolded\u003c/span\u003e⁸\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri\"\u003eWeight: 259g\u003c/span\u003e⁸\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri\"\u003eColors: Black, Gold\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri\"\u003eXiaomi proprietary hinge\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri\"\u003eMulti-level hinge design\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Obj